  "description": "There's never a dull day in the Manhwakyung Editing Department! \n\nThe journey of the editor Baepsae and their colleagues to find new writers and titles continues. \n\nThe real behind-the-scenes stories you can't hear anywhere else!\n\n(Source: Manhwakyung, translated)\n\n*Note:\n\\- Chapter count includes an epilogue\n\\- Manhwakyung (만화경) translated to 'kaleidoscope', but also includes the Korean word for comics, 'manhwa' (만화)\n\\- Baepsae (뱁새) is a Korean crow-tit, otherwise known as the vinous-throated parrotbill*",
